1
00:00:00,821 --> 00:00:02,151
(Raj:)Just a sec.

2
00:00:02,322 --> 00:00:05,982
Oh, who says "just a sec"?
I hate myself.

3
00:00:10,764 --> 00:00:11,784
(Sheldon:)Hello.

4
00:00:11,965 --> 00:00:14,435
(Sheldon:)- Hi.
- Uh, would you like to come in?

5
00:00:14,601 --> 00:00:17,231
Uh, no, I can't stay.

6
00:00:17,404 --> 00:00:18,894
(Raj:)Oh.

7
00:00:19,339 --> 00:00:20,999
(Girl:)I just wanted to say...

8
00:00:21,174 --> 00:00:24,544
(Girl:)...I'm sorry for running out
of the coffee shop. That wasn't cool.

9
00:00:26,646 --> 00:00:28,166
So yeah.

10
00:00:28,348 --> 00:00:29,718
(Penny:)I'm sorry.

11
00:00:30,517 --> 00:00:31,917
(Bernadette:)Wait.

12
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:36,490
(Raj:)Can you at least tell me what went wrong?

13
00:00:36,656 --> 00:00:38,356
(Raj:)It's okay, I can take anything.

14
00:00:38,525 --> 00:00:42,555
(Raj:)Unless it's something I did, or said, or am,
because those are like my buttons.

15
00:00:44,865 --> 00:00:47,195
(Girl:)No, it's not any of that.

16
00:00:49,169 --> 00:00:52,769
(Girl:)It's just, I kind of have a hard time
around people I don't know.

